# libs/librtpi/Makefile.in — Wine-NSPA RT v2.0
#
# Header-only Wine-internal implementation of the librtpi API surface.
#
# NO BUILD TARGET. This directory exists only to host rtpi.h. Consumers
# include it via -I$(top_srcdir)/libs/librtpi on the Unix-side compile
# line of each DLL/tool that needs pi_mutex_t / pi_cond_t.
#
# The header implements pi_mutex_* and pi_cond_* as inline functions
# on top of the FUTEX_LOCK_PI / FUTEX_UNLOCK_PI / FUTEX_WAIT / FUTEX_WAKE
# syscalls. See the header preamble for design details.
#
# For the sweep that rewrites pthread_* → pi_* across Wine's Unix side,
# see nspa/librtpi_sweep.py.
#
# History: this replaces the earlier attempt to vendor upstream librtpi
# sources as a static lib. Upstream librtpi is Unix-native and has no
# Wine build precedent — the header-only shim avoids the autotools
# problem entirely while preserving the librtpi public API surface.
